      "description": "Built wheels of qou's native Python extensions, today only `pyhecke-native` (not on PyPI; a maturin build takes about 2.5 min per container). One orphan branch per package, version, CPython tag, platform and source key, where the source key hashes the git trees of `crates/pyhecke-native` and `crates/hecke-engine`. Read and written by scripts/wheel-cache.sh, which keeps its git objects in a private bare repository rather than the checkout; scripts/build-pyhecke-native.sh restores before it builds by default, but seeds origin only when PYHECKE_NATIVE_PUSH=1 (and never when PYHECKE_NATIVE_NO_SEED=1), after a clean build passes its convention gate. `wheel-cache/` is where a member is mounted; nothing is tracked there. Bean qou-dgkf.",
      "inSubgraph": "https://litlfred.github.io/qou/directory/wheel-cache"
    }
  ]
